---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { links } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="animaEngine collects nothing: the app makes no network connection, and this website sets no cookies and runs no analytics."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Nothing to collect</h1>
      <p class="lead">Neither the app nor this website gathers information about you.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container container-narrow prose body">
    <h2>The app</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>animaEngine makes no network connection of any kind</strong>: no telemetry, no crash reporting, no update
      checks, no accounts, no advertising. Nothing about you, your computer or what is on your screen leaves it.
    </p>
    <p>What it keeps stays on your computer, in your own user’s folders:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        its settings and your scenes, in your configuration folder (<code>~/.config/animaengine</code> on Linux,
        <code>%APPDATA%\animaEngine</code> on Windows);
      </li>
      <li>the pictures you add, in its asset library, and decoded copies of them in a cache folder so they load faster;</li>
      <li>after a crash, a copy of the scene from just before it, for <code>anima-engine --recover</code>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <em>Appearance → About → Copy diagnostic report</em> puts a short text on your clipboard — the app’s version, your
      system’s name, your graphics card and the app’s latest warnings, never the paths of your files. The app sends it
      nowhere; it goes only where you paste it.
    </p>

    <h2>This website</h2>
    <p>
      The site itself sets no cookies, stores nothing in your browser, runs no analytics or advertising, and loads nothing
      from other sites: its fonts, pictures and scripts are served from <code>animaengine.eu</code> itself. Its scripts
      only make the page interactive — playing the clips, suggesting a download for your system — and send nothing
      anywhere.
    </p>
    <p>
      The site is served by Cloudflare. Like any web server, Cloudflare receives your IP address and the usual request
      details with each request; see
      <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare’s privacy policy</a>.
      Downloads come from GitHub’s release pages, under the
      <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub privacy statement</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about privacy: <a href={links.issues} rel="noopener noreferrer">open an issue</a>, or, for a security
      problem, follow the <a href={links.security} rel="noopener noreferrer">security policy</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .body {
    padding-bottom: clamp(64px, 9vw, 120px);
  }
</style>
